"ds-related-work--metadata ds2-5-body-xs">International journal of pure and applied mathematics, 2013</p><p class="ds2-5-body-sm ds-related-work--abstract ">This article explains how to construct a regular heptadecagon according to the theory of cyclotonic equations which was discovered by Gauss in 1796. The author also shows how to construct any root or fraction.</p><div class="ds-related-work--ctas"><a class="ds2-5-text-link ds2-5-text-link--inline js-tc-loswp--wsj-grid-card-download-pdf-modal js-login-button--cbeb6dea"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 18px" translate="no">download</span><span class="ds2-5-text-link__content">Download free PDF</span></a><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
